<title>UK: Spirax drops on continued sterling strength.</title>
<headline>Spirax drops on continued sterling strength.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spirax Sarco Engineering Plc fell on Tuesday, extending recent losses as the second-line engineering sector continued to be dogged by sterling strength, dealers said.</p>
<p>Spirax Sarco shares dropped 40-1/2p to 606p by 1004 GMT.</p>
</text>
